msgstr "Optionale Referenzbezeichnung zur einfachen Identifizierung"

#. module: hr_rfid
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_rfid.hr_rfid_access_group_view_form
msgid ""
"Optionally add Available Access groups - this groups can be added manually\n"
"                                            to Employees in this Department. If no Available groups in Employee setup\n"
"                                            menu you will see <strong>only</strong> Default Access Group!!!"
msgstr ""
"Optional: Fügen Sie verfügbare Zugangskontrollgruppen hinzu – diese Gruppen "
"können manuell den Mitarbeitern in dieser Abteilung zugewiesen werden. Wenn "
"keine verfügbaren Gruppen im Mitarbeiter-Einrichtungsmenü vorhanden sind, "
"sehen Sie <strong>nur</strong> die Standard-Zugangskontrollgruppe!!!"

#. module: hr_rfid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid.field_hr_rfid_access_group__inherited_ids
msgid ""
"Other access groups whose permissions are included in this group. This "
"creates a hierarchy where this group automatically includes all doors from "
"inherited groups. For example, \"Manager Access\" might inherit from "
"\"Employee Access\" to include all employee doors plus additional manager-"
"only doors."
msgstr ""
"Andere Zutrittsgruppen, deren Berechtigungen in dieser Gruppe enthalten "
"sind. Dies erstellt eine Hierarchie, bei der diese Gruppe automatisch alle "
"Türen der geerbten Gruppen umfasst. Beispiel: \"Manager-Zugang\" könnte von "
"\"Mitarbeiter-Zugang\" erben, um alle Mitarbeitertüren plus zusätzliche, nur"
" für Manager zugängliche Türen einzuschließen."

#. module: hr_rfid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid.field_hr_rfid_webstack__shared_company_ids
msgid ""
"Other companies that use this module together with the owner company. They "
"can see its controllers, doors and readers and grant access to their own "
"people with their own access groups. Setting up the module and its hardware,"
" and how long its events are kept, stay with the owner company."
msgstr ""
"Други фирми, които използват този модул заедно с фирмата собственик. Те "
"могат да виждат нейните контролери, врати и четци и да предоставят достъп на"
" своите служители чрез собствени групи за достъп. Настройването на модула и "
"неговия хардуер, както и срокът на съхранение на събитията, остават "
"отговорност на фирмата собственик."

